# `pnpm dev` runs `next dev` with the cwd at `apps/web`, so the default `./data` (PRD 1 §6.8)
# would put the master's database at `apps/web/data` rather than the repo root the docs and
# CLAUDE.md §3 describe. Anchored here rather than in code: the default belongs to the config
# schema, and the cwd is a property of how this app is launched.
#
# A real environment variable still wins — Next never overrides one that is already set — so a
# deployment can point `KWIZ_DATA_DIR` anywhere without touching this file.
KWIZ_DATA_DIR=../../data
